{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"সুনান আবু দাউদ","section":{"42":"Model Behavior of the Prophet (Kitab Al-Sunnah)"},"section_detail":{"42":{"hadithnumber_first":4596,"hadithnumber_last":4772,"arabicnumber_first":4596,"arabicnumber_last":4772,"name_native":"সুন্নাহ অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4603,"arabicnumber":4603,"text":"। আবূ হুরায়রাহ (রাঃ) সূত্রে বর্ণিত। নবী সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম বলেনঃ কুরআন সম্বন্ধে সন্দেহ পোষণ করা কুফরী।[1] হাসান সহীহ।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":42,"hadith":8}}]}